      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey my 7yo son has a really high fever and he's been super fussy all night. i think he might have a flu or something. i have some aspirin in the cabinet but i wasn't sure how much to give him to get the fever down quick. what's a safe dose for his weight? he's about 55lbs.",
